  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "oran: fix Coverity Resource leak",
  "description": "Fix Coverity Resource leak warnings.\n\n`noescape: Resource wmem_strbuf_finalize(xxx) is not freed or pointed-to in printf.`\n\n`leaked_storage: Failing to save or free storage allocated by wmem_strbuf_finalize(xxx) leaks it`\n\n5 variables created by `wmem_strbuf_create(NULL)`.\n\n`wmem_strbuf_finalize()` uses `wmem_realloc(NULL, ...)` for these variables.\n\nThere was no `wmem_free(NULL, ...)` plus all of these are in a for loop so this memory leaks happens more than time...\n\nCoverity CID 1690710 (5 occurrences)\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
  "state": "merged",
